5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to verify if previous initiatives actually improved patient outcomes before spending more.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am concerned about whether our current physical infrastructure can absorb any new program without seizing up.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,History suggests that programs relying on external partners often collapse in year two. We must check dependency risks.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I worry that new programs just add invisible pressure to existing rosters. We need to see the staffing reality.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must ask what this budget can truly build and what it will earn back before committing.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, if the space is already saturated, adding a program is just moving the bottleneck.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,Exactly. The booking screens and approach roads are already at capacity. We need to check the physical limits.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, if the nursing staff is already stretched thin, a new program is just a promise we cannot keep.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Yumi,,Yes. I want to see the vacancy numbers and how much agency cover we are already using.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"I agree. We must look at the ledger to see what is actually available, not just what is promised.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will look at the readmission figures from the last trial to see if it worked.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will check the rooms and parking coverage to see if we have physical space left.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will review the board minutes on the jointly run clinic to see where it failed.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I will look at the ward nursing vacancies and the therapy staffing review to see the load.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will check the development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs to understand the money.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,We should not repeat mistakes. Evidence first.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"If it does not fit, it does not go.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Let us find out who is actually holding the rope before we pull.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I hope the numbers show we have room to breathe.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,Let the numbers speak. They are the only honest witnesses in this room.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
