70,3,3,talk,Asuka,,No. It is entirely on-site. The booking system has slots for it. It will not vanish from the records.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,The booking system has slots for scheduled consultations. Option B fits. It is visible. It is trackable.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
