73,3,3,talk,Yumi,,The midwifery team has slack. The pediatric team has room. It is a good fit. It is kind.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,The ledger can cover it. The fund pays for it. It is the only one that will still be here in a year.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Asuka,,"Option B is the only one with evidence, slack, and space. It is the only one that will work.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
